-- Better short names for the E2 universities (user OK 2026-10-11): the first run cut 313 long names with "…" and
-- uppercased some place names (NANCY). Generated by `python3 supabase/data/europe_all.py shorts` (rules in short():
-- quotes / dash parts dropped, domain → FH Wels, acronym label, initials + place → ABS Paris, part before "of",
-- initials + last word → OTH Amberg-Weiden, SHORT_BY_HAND). Idempotent; only E2 rows with a long name.
